<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E (Doctors will learn how law and healthcare are interconnected and why every clinical act has legal status. This module explains the structure of the legal system, civil vs criminal negligence, and how a medical act becomes a criminal offence.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [27]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E (This module explains the core concept of medical negligence and how courts analyse allegations against doctors. Doctors will learn what constitutes breach of duty, standard of care, and how proper documentation prevents false cases. The focus is on understanding legal boundaries to protect professional reputation.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
233 0 obj
<<
