/Pg 13 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E (This module teaches the essential principles of legally valid consent. Doctors will learn the components of common, common error, and how courts evaluate consent forms. Using model formats and landmark judgments, doctors will learn to draft strong, clear, court-proof consent that builds trust and provides legal protection. All concepts will be demonstrated using model consent formats, so doctors can easily apply them in daily practice. Standard templates and sample consent drafts will be provided for routine use.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
235 0 obj
<<
