/S /P
/P 35 0 R
/E (This module teaches doctors how to write accurate and defensible medical certificates, award certificates, and death certificates. Doctors will learn mandatory identity verification, essential components, and common mistakes that lead to legal complications. Proper certificate writing strengthens credibility in court.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [32]
>>
endobj
